## Frontend (Vite)
# Backend origin for production (optional). In dev, Vite proxy handles /api and /uploads.
# Use the URL only — no "KEY=value" prefix, no quotes, no trailing slash.
# Example: https://halorai-putu.onrender.com
VITE_BACKEND_ORIGIN=

# Public site URL (optional). Use the same value(s) in backend CORS_ORIGINS on Render (comma-separated).
# Example: https://your-app.vercel.app
VITE_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=

# Max number of minister images allowed to upload
VITE_MAX_MINISTERS=3



